  <description>1 effort block peaking at 69% in 120 minutes. Every easy kilometre you ride today pays interest on race day. This enhances your body&apos;s ability to recycle lactate as fuel at low intensity. Boredom is a bigger challenge than fatigue at this intensity.</description>
